    "Details": "The Hades is an exclusive design to Wolf's Dragoons developed from the Loki and is an attempt to rectify that design's poor armor problems while retaining its offensive capabilities. The standard chassis is replaced with an Endo Steel model and the armor is upgraded to Ferro-Fibrous. The Hades maintains the same mobility of the original Loki.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Integrated Searchlight</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.06</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
